			<p><code>ssqch import eleventy</code> (or <code>zola</code>) does the mechanical part and lists what's left to port by hand, each with its file and line. The words you bring along work too, and say ssqch's name once.</p>
			<p>When you think you're done, build the site both ways and run <code>ssqch diff</code> on the two folders. It'll tell you.</p>
		</div>
